l8r2_gndret.py: Layer 8 record l8r2, rounds 7 and 8: board B's ground return, its load basis and its current capacity reconciled
(round 7, the owner's review of 4 October 2026, RSM-01), and the return between boards A and B corrected by a dedicated ground
return and verified over every permitted aged-contact combination (round 8, finding L8R2-F31, after the collaborator's recheck
V3, NOT CONFIRMED). PROTOTYPE DESIGN: nothing is built, bought, powered or measured; nothing here is applied to the tree; no
figure is a measurement; no independent check has read round 8. Case rows cited (inputs/coordinator-cases-2026-10-04-rev3.md):
C-DEV rev 1 for the device rail; C-ALLTX rev 3 where a state of it applies; the slots' loads per state as record l9pwr prints them.

